  day: [["6:30 AM", "Tailboard briefing: review the job, hazards, energy sources and minimum approach distances."], ["7:15 AM", "Inspect rubber gloves, sleeves and fall protection, then set up the work zone with cones and signs."], ["8:00 AM", "Replace a damaged crossarm from the bucket using insulated tools and cover-up."], ["11:00 AM", "Set a new pole with the digger derrick and frame it for a three-phase extension."], ["1:30 PM", "Pull in and sag new conductors to specification."], ["3:30 PM", "Complete paperwork and clean up the site."], ["9:00 PM", "Get called out for a storm outage: patrol the line, find a broken pole and begin restoration."]],
