  day: [["6:30 AM", "Safety briefing and weather check — wind speed limits for climbing and working in the hub."], ["7:00 AM", "Inspect harness and climbing equipment and review the work order and SCADA fault history."], ["7:30 AM", "Climb (or ride the service lift) to the nacelle with your partner."], ["8:30 AM", "Lock out the turbine and perform semi-annual maintenance: torque checks, filter changes and greasing."], ["12:00 PM", "Troubleshoot a pitch system fault, test sensors and replace a faulty encoder."], ["2:30 PM", "Return to service, verify operation with the remote operations center and descend."], ["3:30 PM", "Log work, order parts and prepare the next day’s tasks."]],
